# Backport to the SDOJ-bundled ReXGlue 0.8.0 of upstream rexglue-sdk (github.com/rexglue/rexglue-sdk, BSD-3-Clause):
#   ba3f99b "add SDL3 windowing backend alongside platform backends" (applied as is),
#   f709b92 "replace Win32/GTK windowing with unified SDL3 backend" (SDOJ had not changed the deleted POSIX main;
#            its Win32-only rejects in mnk_input_driver.cpp are left out: Windows builds are not supported here),
#   3529773 "add a Wayland surface type and the VK_KHR_wayland_surface extension" (surface.h, src/ui/CMakeLists.txt,
#            window_sdl.cpp merged by hand; its CI workflow change left out),
#   01bf04b "pick the SDL video driver at runtime instead of forcing x11" (by hand: the video_driver cvar, the
#            surface error and SDLWindowedAppContext::Initialize; its macOS parts left out).
# Plus espgaluda2-recomp's own: the SDL window is created with SDL_WINDOW_VULKAN, and SDL is built with SDL_VULKAN, for the app renderer.
